==Event Information==
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''The Battle Cats 2nd Anniversary Extravaganza is here!'''}}<br>
Thanks for enjoying The Battle Cats with us for {{Color|#FF0000|'''2 years'''}} of incredible fun and tough challenges!
Between {{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 17th and October 8th'''}}, login to The Battle Cats for a {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''one-time gift of a Rare Ticket and a set of Catamins'''}}, and {{Color|#FF6D01|'''20 Cat Food each day for all 22 days!'''}}<br>
Plus, another {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Rare Ticket'''}} at the end of September!

During the celebration, there'll be tons more challenges, rewards, and special sales for all Battle Cats players, whether you're a rookie or a hardcore veteran!<br>
Head to {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Stories of Legend/Event Stages'''}} to try your luck!

Included among these awesome events are:<br>
● 9/17 - 10/8: {{Color|#AA33CC|'''Birthday'''}} and {{Color|#008000|'''Celebration'''}} Stages<br>
● 9/17 - 9/23: {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Crazed/Manic Cats Festival'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, with English ver.-only unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Catburger'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00FF|'''!'''}}<br>
● 9/26 - 10/2: {{Color|#008000|'''Awakened Cats Stages'''}}<br>
● 9/26 - 10/3: Super-tough {{Color|#FF0000|'''Challenge Stages'''}}, including {{Color|#FF0000|'''Clionel Ascendant'''}}, {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day of Judgement'''}}, and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Techneurosis!'''}}<br>
● Weekend Catfruit Festivals, Half-Energy Events, Rare Capsule events and much, much more!

Stay posted for more info throughout the celebrations!
Here's to many more years of Battle Cats fun!!!

